Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GABRIEL GABRIEL GABRIEL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know that bugs don't\Nhave brains like we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what kind of brains do they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their nervous system acts as their brain,\Nand it runs all throughout their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why if you remove their head, an\Ninsect can continue living for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this can stay alive after its head is\Ngone, then I wonder where its soul's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Gabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm bored. Want to hang out? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Alicia's soul is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People aren't like bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't live without our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So a person's soul has\Nto be in their head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be somewhere in the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under her skin, her\Nskull, deep in her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her soul's there, hiding.
