Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asago?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you know it. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dork logged us in\Nand didn't screw it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A world of artificial fluctlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And every one of them with a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human soul.
