Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.12,0:05:55.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF6EEEF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(963.513,875.867)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(3068,3188,\alpha&HFF&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(19,139,\alpha&H00&)\t(3081,3201,\alpha&HFF&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(38,158,\alpha&H00&)\t(3095,3215,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(58,178,\alpha&H00&)\t(3109,3229,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(77,197,\alpha&H00&)\t(3122,3242,\alpha&HFF&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(97,217,\alpha&H00&)\t(3136,3256,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(116,236,\alpha&H00&)\t(3150,3270,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(135,255,\alpha&H00&)\t(3164,3284,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(155,275,\alpha&H00&)\t(3177,3297,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(174,294,\alpha&H00&)\t(3191,3311,\alpha&HFF&)}r {\alpha&HFF&\t(194,314,\alpha&H00&)\t(3205,3325,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(213,333,\alpha&H00&)\t(3219,3339,\alpha&HFF&)}f {\alpha&HFF&\t(233,353,\alpha&H00&)\t(3232,3352,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(252,372,\alpha&H00&)\t(3246,3366,\alpha&HFF&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(271,391,\alpha&H00&)\t(3260,3380,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(291,411,\alpha&H00&)\t(3274,3394,\alpha&HFF&)}D{\alpha&HFF&\t(310,430,\alpha&H00&)\t(3287,3407,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(330,450,\alpha&H00&)\t(3301,3421,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(349,469,\alpha&H00&)\t(3315,3435,\alpha&HFF&)}k {\alpha&HFF&\t(369,489,\alpha&H00&)\t(3329,3449,\alpha&HFF&)}M{\alpha&HFF&\t(388,508,\alpha&H00&)\t(3342,3462,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(407,527,\alpha&H00&)\t(3356,3476,\alpha&HFF&)}g{\alpha&HFF&\t(427,547,\alpha&H00&)\t(3370,3490,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(446,566,\alpha&H00&)\t(3383,3503,\alpha&HFF&)}s {\alpha&HFF&\t(466,586,\alpha&H00&)\t(3397,3517,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(485,605,\alpha&H00&)\t(3411,3531,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(504,624,\alpha&H00&)\t(3425,3545,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(524,644,\alpha&H00&)\t(3438,3558,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(543,663,\alpha&H00&)\t(3452,3572,\alpha&HFF&)}d {\alpha&HFF&\t(563,683,\alpha&H00&)\t(3466,3586,\alpha&HFF&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(582,702,\alpha&H00&)\t(3480,3600,\alpha&HFF&)}D{\alpha&HFF&\t(602,722,\alpha&H00&)\t(3493,3613,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(621,741,\alpha&H00&)\t(3507,3627,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(640,760,\alpha&H00&)\t(3521,3641,\alpha&HFF&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(660,780,\alpha&H00&)\t(3535,3655,\alpha&HFF&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(679,799,\alpha&H00&)\t(3548,3668,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(699,819,\alpha&H00&)\t(3562,3682,\alpha&HFF&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(718,838,\alpha&H00&)\t(3576,3696,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(738,858,\alpha&H00&)\t(3590,3710,\alpha&HFF&)}l
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vixor Ulshasta, head of the Dark Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I pledge my\Nsword, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, now that you've returned\Nafter so long, what do you seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood and terror, fire and\Ndestruction, death and screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The western lands flow with the power of\Nthe gods that banished me from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the great gate that protects\Nthose lands shall crumble very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so I've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world shall know my\Npower and tremble before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Great Gate falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the realm of the humans will\Nbelong to the people of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have but one request of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To bring me the Priestess of Light\Nwho resides in the Human Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have permission to terrorize and\Nmurder any other human, but she is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:07:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go forth, my warriors of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claim your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink their blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smash in their skulls\Nand rip up to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail to the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death to the White Eudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be a big-time\Nactor if you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A speech was called for and I gave it,\Nwhich is a skill you should learn yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you are their superior,\Nthey'll be expecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to give orders or speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to kill some fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen VR be so real, so I figure\NI might as well take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can friggin' taste this wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just remember, there's\Nno pain absorber here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get cut, it'll bleed and hurt. Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes this great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you, Captain? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got back to main control just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanted to make sure your\Ndive didn't have issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, our first day here went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The phenomenon of accelerated time\Ntakes a bit of getting used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than that, everything's going\Nas planned, so I'm not complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have these units equipped\Nand ready in two days, our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll launch the\Nattack on the Human Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, so here's what to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.99,0:09:19.20,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF1EEEF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(966.18,811.867)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(3210,3330,\alpha&HFF&)}M{\alpha&HFF&\t(9,129,\alpha&H00&)\t(3224,3344,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(19,139,\alpha&H00&)\t(3239,3359,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(29,149,\alpha&H00&)\t(3254,3374,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(38,158,\alpha&H00&)\t(3268,3388,\alpha&HFF&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(48,168,\alpha&H00&)\t(3283,3403,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(58,178,\alpha&H00&)\t(3298,3418,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(67,187,\alpha&H00&)\t(3312,3432,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(77,197,\alpha&H00&)\t(3327,3447,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(87,207,\alpha&H00&)\t(3342,3462,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(96,216,\alpha&H00&)\t(3356,3476,\alpha&HFF&)}l {\alpha&HFF&\t(106,226,\alpha&H00&)\t(3371,3491,\alpha&HFF&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(116,236,\alpha&H00&)\t(3386,3506,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(125,245,\alpha&H00&)\t(3400,3520,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(135,255,\alpha&H00&)\t(3415,3535,\alpha&HFF&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(145,265,\alpha&H00&)\t(3430,3550,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(154,274,\alpha&H00&)\t(3444,3564,\alpha&HFF&)}2 {\alpha&HFF&\t(164,284,\alpha&H00&)\t(3459,3579,\alpha&HFF&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(174,294,\alpha&H00&)\t(3474,3594,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(183,303,\alpha&H00&)\t(3488,3608,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(193,313,\alpha&H00&)\t(3503,3623,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(203,323,\alpha&H00&)\t(3518,3638,\alpha&HFF&)}s {\alpha&HFF&\t(212,332,\alpha&H00&)\t(3532,3652,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(222,342,\alpha&H00&)\t(3547,3667,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(232,352,\alpha&H00&)\t(3562,3682,\alpha&HFF&)}d {\alpha&HFF&\t(241,361,\alpha&H00&)\t(3576,3696,\alpha&HFF&)}5{\alpha&HFF&\t(251,371,\alpha&H00&)\t(3591,3711,\alpha&HFF&)}4 {\alpha&HFF&\t(261,381,\alpha&H00&)\t(3606,3726,\alpha&HFF&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(270,390,\alpha&H00&)\t(3620,3740,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(280,400,\alpha&H00&)\t(3635,3755,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(290,410,\alpha&H00&)\t(3650,3770,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(299,419,\alpha&H00&)\t(3664,3784,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(309,429,\alpha&H00&)\t(3679,3799,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(319,439,\alpha&H00&)\t(3694,3814,\alpha&HFF&)}s {\alpha&HFF&\t(328,448,\alpha&H00&)\t(3708,3828,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(338,458,\alpha&H00&)\t(3723,3843,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(348,468,\alpha&H00&)\t(3738,3858,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(357,477,\alpha&H00&)\t(3752,3872,\alpha&HFF&)}o {\alpha&HFF&\t(367,487,\alpha&H00&)\t(3767,3887,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(377,497,\alpha&H00&)\t(3782,3902,\alpha&HFF&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(386,506,\alpha&H00&)\t(3796,3916,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H00&)\t(3811,3931,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(406,526,\alpha&H00&)\t(3826,3946,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(415,535,\alpha&H00&)\t(3840,3960,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(425,545,\alpha&H00&)\t(3855,3975,\alpha&HFF&)}d {\alpha&HFF&\t(435,555,\alpha&H00&)\t(3870,3990,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(444,564,\alpha&H00&)\t(3884,4004,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(454,574,\alpha&H00&)\t(3899,4019,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(464,584,\alpha&H00&)\t(3914,4034,\alpha&HFF&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(473,593,\alpha&H00&)\t(3928,4048,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(483,603,\alpha&H00&)\t(3943,4063,\alpha&HFF&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(492,612,\alpha&H00&)\t(3958,4078,\alpha&HFF&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(502,622,\alpha&H00&)\t(3972,4092,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(512,632,\alpha&H00&)\t(3987,4107,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(522,642,\alpha&H00&)\t(4002,4122,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(531,651,\alpha&H00&)\t(4016,4136,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(541,661,\alpha&H00&)\t(4031,4151,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(551,671,\alpha&H00&)\t(4046,4166,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(560,680,\alpha&H00&)\t(4060,4180,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(570,690,\alpha&H00&)\t(4075,4195,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(580,700,\alpha&H00&)\t(4090,4210,\alpha&HFF&)}e
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you have Alice, get her back to\Nthat terminal and bring up the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be an option there to eject\Nher light cube to the main control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.24,0:09:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Click on that, and Alice's\Nlight cube's as good as ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and while you're there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's something you and that\Ndumbass Vassago should keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we don't have access\Nto admin privileges,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't have the luxury of resetting. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you gents end up getting killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to log you back\Nin with those super-user accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best I can do is send\Nyou back as low-level grunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the SDF up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're so freaked out, they\Ndon't even know you dove in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:09:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, the next time you\Nhear from me, we'll have Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, I hate that asswipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking, maybe I'll head downtown\Nand, you know, blow off a little steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'd prefer it if you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the op's over, you can\Nhave a night all to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, standing down\Non the chicks and murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hit the sack and\Ndream about him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall be your company tonight,\Nif it pleases your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by whose order no one my duty\Nis to indulge your whims, sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My own volition!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then who's your commanding officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you must Have a\Nreason for your treachery?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you do it for money or did\Nsomeone promise You status?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the good of the land?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If war breaks out it will set\NHistory back hundreds of years?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot revert to the old ways where\Nthe Powerless suffered under oppression?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is, just like that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw Alicia's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for a second there, I could\Nsee what her soul was seeing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see more of what it showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a glorious experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though our\NFluctlights are in separate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,light cubes they connected\Nthrough the stl So
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when she died maybe the release of quantum
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,data flowed back to me\Nby way of that connection
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing who\Ncares about the how of it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've experimented with so\Nmany people since Alicia,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, I've experienced\Nthe phenomenon again. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what an average AI soul is\Nlike, Alice's should be extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice, your soul will be\Nsweet, and I shall relish it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.95,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HECEBED&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(975.513,865.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}N{\alpha&HFF&\t(22,142,\alpha&H00&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(44,164,\alpha&H00&)}v{\alpha&HFF&\t(67,187,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(89,209,\alpha&H00&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(112,232,\alpha&H00&)}b{\alpha&HFF&\t(134,254,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(157,277,\alpha&H00&)}r {\alpha&HFF&\t(179,299,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(202,322,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(224,344,\alpha&H00&)}3{\alpha&HFF&\t(246,366,\alpha&H00&)}8{\alpha&HFF&\t(269,389,\alpha&H00&)}0 {\alpha&HFF&\t(291,411,\alpha&H00&)}({\alpha&HFF&\t(314,434,\alpha&H00&)}H{\alpha&HFF&\t(336,456,\alpha&H00&)}.{\alpha&HFF&\t(359,479,\alpha&H00&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(381,501,\alpha&H00&)}.{\alpha&HFF&\t(404,524,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(426,546,\alpha&H00&)}.{\alpha&HFF&\t(449,569,\alpha&H00&)})
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, all preparations are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are ready to launch the\Nassault whenever it pleases you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The life of the Eastern Gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which has divided the Human Empire and\Nthe Land of Darkness since creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will expire soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Five Tribes are excited\Nabout the prospect of war
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the bounty of resources\Nthe Human Empire contains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, each Integrity Knight is worth\Na thousand of our warriors in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The edge we have in our numbers\Nshall be whittled down in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating them may be possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but by the time we do, we will\Nhave suffered severe losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, it will lead to an\Nimbalance of power among the tribes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Council of Ten will be powerless,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the treaty among the five\Ntribes will be rescinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happens, it will become\Nanother age of blood and iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cannot come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only hope is to make\Npeace with the human empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must speak with Bercouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.16,0:16:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am certain he would agree\Nto our request for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I must kill the\None who stands in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, last night I discovered\Nan intruder in my chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had a dagger hidden in their hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, I won't condemn whoever\Nsent the assassin after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to have more power, there is\Nnothing wrong using treachery to obtain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you desire the throne, feel\Nfree to attack me however you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that said,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you decide to embark on such a gamble,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know that the consequences\Nwill be most severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, this traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must have peace for the sake of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds so hypocritical,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially coming from the\Ncommander of the Dark Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my lord, that is why I\Nlove you and always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison coursing\Nthrough you is so potent,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can kill a land dragon with a life\Nof over 30,000 in less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And compared to your stamina and total\Nlife, you'll be dead in about three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dear, they won't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, a black void, does\Nthis man not know life?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows nothing of the radiance\Nof life, of love, of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he seeks other souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful\Nmy incarnate ability was,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this man cannot be defeated by\Na weapon of murderous intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a soul, but it is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Lipia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The troops who lost their\Ncommanders shall appoint
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoever is the next\Nhighest rank to lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will begin the assault as\Nplanned one hour from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long live Vecta, the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:20.46,0:21:24.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&HF9FEFE&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.97,0:21:27.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:21:27.99,0:21:32.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.10,0:21:35.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFAFAFA&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.15,0:21:37.56,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.56,0:21:44.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H372317&}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.99,0:21:49.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H342517&}So bright that they hurt to look at now
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.81,0:21:57.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H45443F&\t(5338,5963,\c&H635253&)}If I was capable of living life all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're alone, you'll be\Nable to live with one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.86,0:22:05.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H23241A&}I never would have loved in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your scent, it's your story.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.78,0:22:10.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H351405&\t(610,1903,\c&H5B3445&)}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.93,0:22:14.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H2C1428&}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the body of love.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.97,0:22:22.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H5A3E4A&}Pieces of love still linger all over my body
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my dream!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.65,0:22:31.83,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H3F2930&}My only wish, my only wish is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dream!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:31.83,0:22:39.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}May you, wherever you are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.68,0:22:40.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}Be crying too
Dialogue: 4,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFEFEFE&}Be crying too
