Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, the Eastern Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold here, Amayori.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroyed at the last stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are out of time.
